INSERT INTO `kb_article` VALUES (3,'会管连接达梦数据库DCS版本部署','<p style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;\">基于湖北生态环保厅项目，部署连接达梦8版本数据库的DCS程序。</p><p style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;\">服务器操作系统麒麟V10_x86</p><p style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:18.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><ol><li data-list-item-id=\"e2901a32e7752b873b527dde17d466be3\"><p>部署unixODBC</p><p>下载地址：<a href=\"https://eco.dameng.com/document/dm/zh-cn/start/C_C++_development.html\">https://eco.dameng.com/document/dm/zh-cn/start/C_C++_development.html</a></p><p><img src=\"/media/image_e12c3w2.png\" width=\"553\" height=\"274\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>unixODBC-2.3.12.tar.gz上传到会管服务器/opt目录下，执行离线部署：</p><p>[root@localhost / ]# cd /opt</p><p>[root@localhost opt]# tar zxvf unixODBC-2.3.12.tar.gz</p><p>[root@localhost opt]# cd unixODBC-2.3.12/</p><p>[root@localhost unixODBC-2.3.12]# ./configure --sysconfdir=/etc</p><p>[root@localhost unixODBC-2.3.12]# make</p><p>[root@localhost unixODBC-2.3.12]# make install</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>执行odbcinst -j命令，可以看到如下返回，则unixODBC部署成功</p><p>[root@localhost unixODBC-2.3.12]# odbcinst -j</p><p>unixODBC 2.3.12</p><p>DRIVERS............: /etc/odbcinst.ini</p><p>SYSTEM DATA SOURCES: /etc/odbc.ini</p><p>FILE DATA SOURCES..: /etc/ODBCDataSources</p><p>USER DATA SOURCES..: /root/.odbc.ini</p><p>SQLULEN Size.......: 8</p><p>SQLLEN Size........: 8</p><p>SQLSETPOSIROW Size.: 8</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>将一台安装过达梦8数据库的服务器下，安装目录中的/dm8/drivers/odbc/取出，放入会管服务器/usr/local/PCMS/下，并赋权。</p><p>将文件包中的odbc.zip上传至/opt目录下，执行以下命令：</p><p>[root@localhost /]# mv /opt/odbc.zip /usr/local/PCMS/</p><p>[root@localhost /]# cd /usr/local/PCMS/</p><p>[root@localhost PCMS]# unzip odbc.zip</p><p>[root@localhost PCMS]# chmod -R 755 odbc/</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>修改unixODBC配置，编辑/etc/odbcinst.ini</p><p>文件最后添加如下信息：</p><p>[DM8 ODBC DRIVER]</p><p>Description=DM ODBC DRIVER FOR DM8</p><p>Driver=/usr/local/PCMS/odbc/libdodbc.so&nbsp; &nbsp;# libdodbc.so驱动路径，须有读权限</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_owzxw8w.png\" width=\"553\" height=\"538\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>编辑 /root/.odbc.ini和/etc/odbc.ini</p><p>添加配置的数据库要用对应的创建用户名和密码，如下：</p><p>[DM]</p><p>Description=DM ODBC DSN&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; #用于描述该数据源的用途或名称，便于识别</p><p>DRIVER=DM8 ODBC DRIVER&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; #和前文/etc/odbcinst.ini下Description需一致</p><p>SERVER=192.168.0.101&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; #达梦数据库地址</p><p>UID=PCMS&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; #连接用户</p><p>PWD=LINKcare1503&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; #连接密码</p><p>TCP_PORT=5236&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; #连接端口</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_5OayFRB.png\" width=\"518\" height=\"204\"></p><p>若原本没有/root/.odbc.ini文件，直接vi创建即可</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>执行isql -v DM命令，若显示Connected!&nbsp;则配置成功，如下：</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_LYz4Spp.png\" width=\"344\" height=\"180\"></p><p>可能会出现的问题以及解决办法：</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"eacaf8306910f4228d8f8e8187a7304bf\">若出现[S1000][unixODBC]用户名或密码错误，[ISQL]ERROR: Could not SQLConnect。——是连接数据库用户名密码的问题，则检查/root/.odbc.ini和/etc/odbc.ini中配置的用户名密码，且直接用数据库连接工具登录测试用户名密码正确性。</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e5c8320d9afcddefc2ad4f9e59aac37ad\">若出现[01000][unixODBC][Driver Manager]Can\'t open lib \'/usr/local/PCMS/odbc/libdodbc.so\' : file not found。——可能是因为unixODBC找不到libdodbc.so文件，检查前文上传的odbc.zip解压后有没有放入正确的路径，以及是否赋权。</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ec33e2cba77f558ac517ac8fc01922076\"><p>若报错Data source name not found and no default driver specified。——需执行odbcinst -j再次检查返回值中的配置文件路径，根据返回值中的配置文件路径找到配置文件，打开检查配置是否正确。</p><p>&nbsp;</p></li><li data-list-item-id=\"e31b477c28c1e119616a0f86216627116\"><p>部署DCS的pcms程序</p><p>上传pcms文件到服务器，备份原先版本的pcms，更新pcms，赋权，操作略</p><p>修改DCS配置文件，如下：</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_LXLRVlE.png\" width=\"554\" height=\"588\"></p><p>进入DCS目录下，手动执行pcms程序，查看返回，命令如下：</p><p>[root@localhost /]# cd /usr/local/PCMS/PCMS/</p><p>[root@localhost PCMS]# ./pcms</p><p>可能会出现如下报错：</p><p>./pcms: error while loading shared libraries: libdodbc.so: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory</p><p><img src=\"/media/image.png\" width=\"554\" height=\"37\"></p><p>是因为pcms程序依赖的libdodbc.so没找到</p><p>用ldd pcms查看程序依赖库</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_vtcuiSf.png\" width=\"553\" height=\"491\"></p><p>可以看到，libdodbc.so、libdmdpi.so、libdmfldr.so都找不到，而其他的依赖库文件都在/usr/lib64目录下。</p><p>libdodbc.so、libdmdpi.so、libdmfldr.so也是在前文的odbc.zip中，被放在/usr/local/PCMS/下了，所以直接在/usr/lib64中创建这些文件的软链接，如下：</p><p>ln -s /usr/local/PCMS/odbc/libdodbc.so /usr/lib64/libdodbc.so</p><p>ln -s /usr/local/PCMS/odbc/libdmdpi.so /usr/lib64/libdmdpi.so</p><p>ln -s /usr/local/PCMS/odbc/libdmfldr.so /usr/lib64/libdmfldr.so</p><p>执行完之后再ldd pcms看下</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_iD7VIC6.png\" width=\"554\" height=\"555\"></p><p>已经看到能找到依赖库文件了，再 ./pcms&nbsp;试下</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_aYGfwZ7.png\" width=\"409\" height=\"54\"></p><p>表示手动执行可以正常运行了，再尝试用服务启动</p><p>service pcms start</p><p>若出现手动执行正常，服务启动报错，则需要改下pcms.service的配置文件</p><p>/usr/lib/systemd/system/pcms.service</p><p>红框处加入如下配置：</p><p>Enviroment=\"LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/PCMS/odbc:LD_LIBRARY_PATH\"</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_DtlwNW5.png\" width=\"553\" height=\"361\"></p><p>保存退出后，执行systemctl daemon-reload命令，再尝试启动pcms服务</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_9HbswQ1.png\" width=\"387\" height=\"87\"></p><p>正确启动，配置完毕。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#EE0000;\"><strong>备注：当前会管的DCS程序中写死的是连接PCMS实例名，如项目中遇到必须要更改实例名，联系研发处理。</strong></span></p></li></ol>','project','V6.7.0','湖北生态环保厅','DCS,达梦',2,1,'2026-01-05 07:24:34.349340','2026-01-05 08:33:02.730840',4),(4,'华侨城mysql数据库双机主主同步配置','<h2>基于MYSQL 8.0.27的数据库主主配置</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>注意事项：</p><ol><li data-list-item-id=\"e5a2d879f7b0d247a1aeea20fdaccb480\">确保两台数据库数据保持一致</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e5087b5b87abf112c95431dcfdd10e70f\">确保热备配置前数据没有修改操作</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e65e18a4eb61e915c240b56aaf1c3f999\">检查两台服务器系统的hostname是否一致，需要修改为<span style=\"color:red;\">不一致</span></li></ol><h2>1&nbsp;创建复制账号</h2><h3 style=\"margin-left:10.5pt;\">1.1 A服务器</h3><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">创建主服务器上copy账号，只允许从服务器访问，账号@从服务器地址</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">create user \'copy_user\'@\'B服务器ip\' identified by \'support\';</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">grant replication slave on *.* to \'copy_user\'@\'B服务器ip\'；</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">刷新数据库</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">flush privileges;</p><h3 style=\"margin-left:10.5pt;\">1.2 B服务器</h3><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">创建主服务器上copy账号，只允许主服务器访问，账号@主服务器地址</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">create user \'copy_user\'@\'A服务器ip\' identified by \'support\';</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">grant replication slave on *.* to \'copy_user\'@\'A服务器ip\';</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">刷新数据库</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">flush privileges;</p><div class=\"page-break\" style=\"page-break-after:always;\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&nbsp;</span></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>2&nbsp;数据库环境调整</h2><h3 style=\"margin-left:10.5pt;\">2.1&nbsp;配置文件修改</h3><p>liunx服务器是修改 /etc/my.cnf</p><p>windows&nbsp;服务器是修改 C:\\ProgramData\\MySQL\\MySQL Server 8.0\\my.ini</p><p>找到“server-id=”，然后进行添加表中的参数：</p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:695px;\"><table style=\"border-style:none;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border-color:windowtext;height:257px;padding:0px 7px;vertical-align:top;width:46px;\"><p style=\"margin-left:5.65pt;\"><strong>服务器A</strong></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:windowtext;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;height:257px;padding:0px 7px;vertical-align:top;width:649px;\"><p>#主服务器的ID值,将原id=1修改为服务器网络号 如123，两个服务器的配置不能相同。</p><p>server-id=123&nbsp;</p><p>#启用binlog功能，指定二进制日志的存储目录</p><p>log-bin=C:\\ProgramData\\MySQL\\MySQL Server 8.0\\log-bin.log&nbsp;</p><p>#设置最大100MB</p><p>max_binlog_size=104857600 &nbsp;</p><p>#设置了只保留7天BINLOG</p><p>expire_logs_days =15</p><p>#binlog日志只记录指定库的更新，要修改为热备的库明，如pcms&nbsp;多个库用，号隔开</p><p>binlog-do-db = pcms</p><p>#binlog日志不记录指定库的更新，必须设置</p><p>binlog-ignore-db = information_schema,performance_schema,mysql</p><p>#replicate_do_db=pcms</p><p>#replicate_ignore_db=information_schema,performance_schema,mysql</p><p>#忽略指定表</p><p>replicate_wild_ignore_table=pcms.nst_t_mcu</p><p>replicate_wild_ignore_table=pcms.nst_t_server_hard_status</p><p>#自增偏移</p><p>auto-increment-increment=2</p><p>auto-increment-offset=2</p><p>#忽略错误</p><p>slave_skip_errors=1062,1032</p><p>#用从属服务器上的日志功能</p><p>log-slave-updates</p><p>#经过1日志写操作就把日志文件写入硬盘一次(对日志信息进行一次同步)。n=1是最安全的做法，但效率最低。默认设置是n=0。</p><p>sync_binlog=1</p><p>binlog_format = MIXED</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:windowtext;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;height:257px;padding:0px 7px;vertical-align:top;width:46px;\"><p style=\"margin-left:5.65pt;\"><strong>服务器B</strong></p></td><td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid windowtext;border-left-style:none;border-right:1px solid windowtext;border-top-style:none;height:257px;padding:0px 7px;vertical-align:top;width:649px;\"><p>#主服务器的ID值,将原id=1修改为服务器网络号 如124，两个服务器的配置不能相同。</p><p>server-id=124&nbsp;</p><p>#启用binlog功能，指定二进制日志的存储目录</p><p>log-bin=C:\\ProgramData\\MySQL\\MySQL Server 8.0\\log-bin.log&nbsp;</p><p>#设置最大100MB</p><p>max_binlog_size=104857600&nbsp;</p><p>#设置了只保留7天BINLOG</p><p>expire_logs_days = 7&nbsp;</p><p>#binlog日志只记录指定库的更新，要修改为热备的库明，如pcms&nbsp;多个库用，号隔开</p><p>binlog-do-db = pcms</p><p>#binlog日志不记录指定库的更新，必须设置</p><p>binlog-ignore-db = information_schema,performance_schema</p><p>#因为设置了不记录其他库的binlog日志，因此以下可以不配置</p><p>#忽略指定表</p><p>replicate_wild_ignore_table=pcms.nst_t_mcu</p><p>replicate_wild_ignore_table=pcms.nst_t_server_hard_status</p><p>#自增偏移</p><p>auto-increment-increment=2</p><p>auto-increment-offset=2</p><p>#忽略错误</p><p>slave_skip_errors=1062,1032</p><p>#用从属服务器上的日志功能</p><p>log-slave-updates</p><p>#经过1日志写操作就把日志文件写入硬盘一次(对日志信息进行一次同步)。n=1是最安全的做法，但效率最低。默认设置是n=0。</p><p>sync_binlog=1</p><p>binlog_format = MIXED</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3 style=\"margin-left:10.5pt;\">2.2 uuid修改</h3><p>windows下，在C:\\ProgramData\\MySQL\\MySQL Server 8.0\\Data文件下，修改auto.cnf，将数值最后2位进行修改，然后保存。重启服务</p><p>linux下，在/var/lib/mysql/Data下，修改auto.cnf，将数值最后2位进行修改，然后保存。重启服务</p><p><span style=\"color:red;\">这里可以删除进行操作auto.cnf，windows下湖北交通厅和华侨城配置时是这样操作的</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_Zf6Hnw9.png\" width=\"553\" height=\"265\"></p><p>重启mysql服务后，使用以下命令进行查看，确保主备机id值不一致。</p><p>show variables like \'server_id\';&nbsp;&nbsp;查看server_id</p><p>show variables like \'%server_uuid%\';&nbsp;查看server_uuid</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_WI3tXdt.png\" width=\"554\" height=\"128\"></p><p><img src=\"/media/image_Or7IrrI.png\" width=\"553\" height=\"111\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>3&nbsp;数据库Slave配置</h2><h3 style=\"margin-left:10.5pt;\">3.1 A服务器</h3><p>在B服务器上，使用sql查询数据库的File和Position参数“show master status\\G”，并进行记录</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_0aHMgXl.png\" width=\"554\" height=\"138\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>使用命令“stop slave;&nbsp;”停止备份服务</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_yCuHgjY.png\" width=\"427\" height=\"46\"></p><p>使用命令“show slave status\\G”检查slave配置</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_H0BNcc9.png\" width=\"313\" height=\"34\"></p><p>使用命令“change master to master_host=\'192.168.0.143\',master_user=\'master_user\',master_password=\'support\',master_log_file=\'log-bin.000004\',master_log_pos=156,master_connect_retry=10,master_ssl=1;”配置slave参数</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_aFA66MM.png\" width=\"698\" height=\"46\"></p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">master_host&nbsp;源数据库服务器地址</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">master_user&nbsp;源数据库配置的备份账号 建议创建账号时两个数据库保持一致，方便好记</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">Master_password 源数据库备份账号的密码</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">Master_log_file 源数据库上查询到的file参数</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">Master_log_pos 源数据库上查询到的Position参数</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">master_connect_retry 连接中断保活</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">master_ssl=1&nbsp;解决caching_sha2_password加密的账号密码无法连接问题</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>使用命令“mysql&gt;start slave;”启动数据库备份服务</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_WrOtkBQ.png\" width=\"425\" height=\"54\"></p><p>检查备份功能是否成功</p><p>执行命令：show slave status\\G</p><p>查看展示结果中的Slave_IO_Running: Yes和Slave_SQL_Running: Yes 是否为YES，yes表示成功。</p><h3 style=\"margin-left:10.5pt;\">3.2 B服务器</h3><p>在A服务器上，使用sql查询数据库的File和Position参数“show master status\\G”，并进行记录</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_OEPPVl8.png\" width=\"554\" height=\"138\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>使用命令“stop slave;&nbsp;”停止备份服务</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_8KYJghV.png\" width=\"427\" height=\"46\"></p><p>使用命令“show slave status\\G”检查slave配置</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_hoCFu9T.png\" width=\"313\" height=\"34\"></p><p>使用命令“change master to master_host=\'192.168.0.142\',master_user=\'master_user\',master_password=\'support\',master_log_file=\'log-bin.000004\',master_log_pos=156,master_connect_retry=10,master_ssl=1;”配置slave参数。</p><p>使用命令“mysql&gt;start slave;”启动数据库备份服务</p><p><img src=\"/media/image_yFPNzTZ.png\" width=\"425\" height=\"54\"></p><p>检查备份功能是否成功</p><p>执行命令：show slave status\\G</p><p>查看展示结果中的Slave_IO_Running: Yes和Slave_SQL_Running: Yes 是否为YES，yes表示成功。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>4&nbsp;问题处理</h2><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ee1ccb0c5b84fd88744c46339f3148bb8\">show slave status&nbsp;查看出现报错ERROR 1872 (HY000): Slave failed to initialize relay log info structure from the repositor&nbsp;</li></ul><p>解决方案：使用sql“reset slave”处理</p><p>给binlog加注释，默认mysql的binlog存储row级别的日志，就是二进制日志，代表了对表的每行操作都会有记录，这样的日志好处是，不会因为表的关联导致主备无法插入数据。</p><p>但是日志文件中没有明文的DML语句，若要查询DML语句，给binlog设置增加注释的功能 set binlog_rows_query_log_events=1; flush logs;使用 mysqlbinlog查看 mysqlbinlog mysql-bin.000025 -vv --base64-output=decode-rows</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e20bbb87175a8fcba32b9eb685601f218\">show slave status&nbsp;查看出现报错Authentication plugin \'caching_sha2_password\' reported error:Authentication require secure connection​</li></ul><p>解决方案：change master to增加参数 master_SSL=1,&nbsp;解决</p><p>caching_sha2_password和复制</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;在所有服务器已升级到MySQL 8.0.4或更高版本的复制方案中，与主/主服务器的从/副本连接可以使用通过caching_sha2_password身份验证的帐户。对于此类连接，同样的要求适用于使用通过caching_sha2_password身份验证的帐户的其他客户端，使用安全连接或基于RSA的密码交换。</p><p>--：要连接到caching_sha2_password&nbsp;主/从复制的帐户：</p><p>&nbsp;①：对于使用OpenSSL构建的MySQL，请使用以下任一 CHANGE MASTER TO选项：</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MASTER_SSL = 1</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;GET_MASTER_PUBLIC_KEY = 1</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;MASTER_PUBLIC_KEY_PATH=\'path to RSA public key file\'</p><p>&nbsp;②：对于MySQL使用wolfSSL，使用 MASTER_SSL=1带 CHANGE MASTER TO。或者，</p><p>&nbsp; 如果在服务器启动时提供了所需的密钥，则可以使用与RSA公钥相关的选项。</p><p>--：要连接到caching_sha2_password&nbsp;组复制的帐户：</p><p>&nbsp;①：对于使用OpenSSL构建的MySQL，请设置以下任何系统变量：</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;SET GLOBAL group_replication_recovery_use_ssl = ON;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;SET GLOBAL group_replication_recovery_get_public_key = 1;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;SET GLOBAL group_replication_recovery_public_key_path = \'path to RSA public key file\';</p><p>&nbsp;②：对于使用wolfSSL构建的MySQL，请设置此系统变量：</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;SET GLOBAL group_replication_recovery_use_ssl = ON;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;或者，如果在服务器启动时提供了所需的密钥，则可以使用与RSA公钥相关的选项。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e7a33f294291b8a4f5a9869cfe05f4890\">在data的错误日志中查看错误提示： [Warning] Storing MySQL user name or password information in the master info repository is not secure and is therefore not recommended. Please consider using the USER and PASSWORD connection options for START SLAVE; see the \'START SLAVE Syntax\' in the MySQL Manual for more information.</li></ul><p>解决方案：两台服务器的hostname一致导致，修改后解决</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ec7514754750fe62b9c78439d7f4d1740\">在data的错误日志中查看错误提示：“Slave I/o thread for channel‘’”</li></ul><p>解决方案： slave连接异常未能获取binlog导致，change master to增加参数“master_hearbeat_period =150”，设置延迟 set global slave_net_timeout = 300</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ed562741209d0a7ee67f699585d1e2867\">show slave status&nbsp;查看出现报错“hostname xxx does not resolve to”</li></ul><p>解决方案：主备机的hostname一致导致，修改主备机的hostname解决</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">同步停止，show slave status&nbsp;查看是Slave_SQL_Running停止，SELECT *FROM performance_schema.`replication_applier_status_by_worker`查看错误原因，“<span style=\"color:red;\">Worker 1 failed executing transaction \'ANONYMOUS\' at master log log-bin.000004, end_log_pos 19458362; Could not execute <i><strong>Write_rows event on table pcms.nst_t_email; Duplicate entry \'10128\' for key \'nst_t_email.PRIMARY\', Error_code: 1062;</strong></i> handler error HA_ERR_FOUND_DUPP_KEY; the event\'s master log log-bin.000004, end_log_pos 19458362</span>”</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">原因说明：主键自增长不同步导致，数据库重启后，单独操作了表导致自增长值不一致</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">解决方案：</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">1、当应用程序运行时不重启数据库</p><p style=\"margin-left:42.0pt;\">2、主备机保持主键自增长不一致，主机偶数增长，备机奇数增长</p><p style=\"margin-left:94.5pt;\">auto_increment_increment=2 #&nbsp;自增因子(每次加2)</p><p style=\"margin-left:94.5pt;\">auto_increment_offset=1 #&nbsp;自增偏移(从1开始)，单数</p><p style=\"margin-left:94.5pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:42.0pt;\">3、忽略错误，会导致数据不一致</p><p style=\"margin-left:84.0pt;\">slave_skip_errors=1062&nbsp;#1062时主键冲突错误 1032&nbsp;数据不一致 all所有错误</p><p style=\"margin-left:84.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:84.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e1717cb3070a39049a9f01b0aef4d1a11\">show slave status&nbsp;查看出现报错\"handler error HA_ERR_KEY_NOT_FOUND...end_log_pos 402, Error_code: 1032\"造成主从无法及时同步</li></ul><p>解决方案：change master to增加参数“master_connect_retry=10&nbsp;”解决</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e2fc9fe56feb7d3f64c90bd060122073a\">show slave status&nbsp;查看出现报错\"got fatal error 1236 from master when reading data from binary log:could not find first log file name in binary log index file\"造成主从无法及时同步</li></ul><p>解决方案：目前解决方案，重新设置同步节点，停止会管服务，停止slave，然后配置“</p><p>CHANGE MASTER TO&nbsp;</p><p>MASTER_LOG_FILE = \'log-bin.000019\',</p><p>MASTER_LOG_POS = 156;</p><p>”可以恢复</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>https://www.ssfiction.com/sqljc/808944.html</p><p>01&nbsp;常见故障1</p><p>&nbsp; [error] plugin group_replication reported: \'this member has more executed transactions than those present in the group. local transactions: bb874065-c485-11e8-8b52-000c2934472e:1 &gt; group transactions: 3db33b36-0e51-409f-a61d-c99756e90155:1-11\'&nbsp; [error] plugin group_replication reported: \'the member contains transactions not present in the group. the member will now exit the group.\'&nbsp; [note] plugin group_replication reported:&nbsp;‘to force this member into the group you can use the group_replication_allow_local_disjoint_gtids_join option\'</p><p>解决方案：</p><p style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;\">根据提示打开set global group_replication_allow_local_disjoint_gtids_join=on;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>02&nbsp;常见故障2</p><p>&nbsp; [error] plugin group_replication reported: \'this member has more executed transactions than those present in the group. local transactions: bb874065-c485-11e8-8b52-000c2934472e:1 &gt; group transactions: 3db33b36-0e51-409f-a61d-c99756e90155:1-15\'&nbsp; [warning] plugin group_replication reported: \'the member contains transactions not present in the group. it is only allowed to join due to group_replication_allow_local_disjoint_gtids_join option\'&nbsp; [note] plugin group_replication reported: \'this server is working as secondary member with primary member address localhost.localdomaion:3306.\'</p><p>解决方案：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>该故障和故障1的不同之处在于该问题出现时，参数group_replication_allow_local_disjoint_gtids_join已经设置成为on了。解决该问题的方法是执行reset master就行，然后重新在主节点和从节点开启通道，即</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>change master to master_user=’rpl_user’, master_password=’rpl_pass’ for channel&nbsp;‘group_replication_recovery’;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>03&nbsp;常见故障3</p><p>本机测试时，遇到下面的问题</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; [warning] storing mysql user name or password information in the master info repository is not secure and is therefore not recommended. please consider using the user and password connection options for start slave; see the \'start slave syntax\' in the mysql manual for more information.&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] slave i/o for channel \'group_replication_recovery\': error connecting to master \'rpl_user@localhost.localdomaion:\' - retry-time: 60 retries: 1, error_code: 2005&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] plugin group_replication reported: \'there was an error when connecting to the donor server. please check that group_replication_recovery channel credentials and all member_host column values of performance_schema.replication_group_members table are correct and dns resolvable.\'&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] plugin group_replication reported: \'for details please check performance_schema.replication_connection_status table and error log messages of slave i/o for channel group_replication_recovery.\'&nbsp; &nbsp;[note] plugin group_replication reported: \'retrying group recovery connection with another donor. attempt /\'</p><p>解决方案：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>这个问题是由于测试环境上三台主机的hostname设置成为了同一个名称，改了hostname之后，这个问题就解决了。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>04&nbsp;常见故障4</p><p>&nbsp; #在线上正式环境操作时，出现下面的错误，&nbsp; mysql--root@localhost:(none) ::&gt;&gt;start group_replication;&nbsp; error (hy000): the server is not configured properly to be an active member of the group. please see more details on error log.&nbsp;#查看log文件，发现只有一个warning：&nbsp; 2019-02-20t07::30.233937z [warning] plugin group_replication reported: \'group replication requires slave-preserve-commit-order to be set to on when using more than 1 applier threads.</p><p>解决方案：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; mysql--root@localhost:(none) ::&gt;&gt;show variables like \"%preserve%\";&nbsp;+--------------------------------+---------+&nbsp; | variable_name&nbsp; &nbsp; | value |&nbsp;+--------------------------------+---------+&nbsp; | slave_preserve_commit_order | off |&nbsp;+--------------------------------+---------+&nbsp; &nbsp;row in set (0.01 sec)&nbsp; mysql--root@localhost:(none) ::&gt;&gt;set global slave_preserve_commit_order=;&nbsp;query ok, rows affected (0.00 sec)</p><p>05&nbsp;常见问题5</p><p>&nbsp; 2019-02-20t08::31.088437z [warning] plugin group_replication reported: \'[gcs] connection attempt from ip address 192.168.9.208 refused.&nbsp; &nbsp;address is not in the ip whitelist.\'&nbsp;2019-02-20t08::32.088676z [warning] plugin group_replication reported: \'[gcs] connection attempt from ip address 192.168.9.208 refused.&nbsp; &nbsp;address is not in the ip whitelist.\'</p><p>解决方法：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在my.cnf中配置group_replication_ip_whitelist参数即可解决</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>06&nbsp;常见问题6</p><p>&nbsp; 2019-02-20t08::44.087492z [warning] plugin group_replication reported: \'read failed\'&nbsp;2019-02-20t08::44.096171z [error] plugin group_replication reported: \'[gcs] the member was unable to join the group. local port: 24801\'&nbsp; 2019-02-20t08::14.065775z [error] plugin group_replication reported: \'timeout on wait for view after joining group</p><p>解决方案：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 将my.cnf中的参数group_replication_group_seeds设置为只包含除自身外其他group成员的ip地址以及内部通信端口，如果写成group所有成员的ip地址，则会出现这个错误，这和相同网段的mgr部署方式有些差异。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>07&nbsp;常见问题7</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] plugin group_replication reported:&nbsp;‘[gcs] error on opening a connection to oceanbase07: on local port: \'.\'&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] plugin group_replication reported:&nbsp;‘[gcs] error on opening a connection to oceanbase08: on local port: \'.\'&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] plugin group_replication reported:&nbsp;‘[gcs] error on opening a connection to oceanbase07: on local port: \'.\'</p><p>解决方案：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>未开通防火墙上的固定端口，开通防火墙之后即可解决</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>08&nbsp;常见问题8</p><p>&nbsp; [warning] storing mysql user name or password information in the master info repository is not secure and is therefore not recommended. please consider using the user and password connection options for start slave; see the \'start slave syntax\' in the mysql manual for more information.&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] slave i/o for channel \'group_replication_recovery\': master command com_register_slave failed: access denied for user \'rpl_user\'@\'%\' (using password: yes) (errno: 1045), error_code: 1597&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] slave i/o thread couldn\'t register on master&nbsp; [note] slave i/o thread exiting for channel \'group_replication_recovery\', read up to log \'first\', position&nbsp;</p><p>解决方案：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>漏掉了某个节点的用户，为了保险起见，在group节点上执行</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>create user rpl_user@’%’;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>grant replication slave on *.* to rpl_user@’%’ identified by&nbsp;‘rpl_pass’;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>09&nbsp;常见问题9</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] failed to open the relay log \'./localhost-relay-bin.000011\' (relay_log_pos ).&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] could not find target log file mentioned in relay log info in the index file \'./work_nat_1-relay-bin. index\' during relay log initialization.&nbsp; [error] slave: failed to initialize the master info structure for channel \'\'; its record may still be present in \'mysql.slave_master_info\' table, consider deleting it.&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] failed to open the relay log \'./localhost-relay-bin-group_replication_recovery.000001\' (relay_log_pos&nbsp; ).&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] could not find target log file mentioned in relay log info in the index file \'./work_nat_1-relay-bin-group_replication_recovery.index\' during relay log initialization.&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] slave: failed to initialize the master info structure for channel \'group_replication_recovery\'; its record may still be present in \'mysql.slave_master_info\' table, consider deleting it.&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] failed to create or recover replication info repositories.&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] slave sql for channel \'\': slave failed to initialize relay log info structure from the repository, error_code:&nbsp; &nbsp;[error] /usr/local/mysql/bin/mysqld: slave failed to initialize relay log info structure from the repository&nbsp; [error] failed to start slave threads for channel \'\'</p><p>解决这个错误是由于slave节点由于某种原因导致找不到relay-log的位置了，需要重新reset slave</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>方法一、该异常时由于mysql slave备机不存在该记录，但是主机master删除时无需报1032错误，可以通过my.cnf可配置slave-skip-errors=1032&nbsp;从而跳过日志中1032 ERROR报错</p><p>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>[root@centos-cluster-s19423 ~]# vi&nbsp;/etc/my.cnf</p><p>...</p><p>slave-skip-errors=1032</p><p>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>方法二、登录到mysql进行set global sql_slave_skip_counter=1; &nbsp;默认0&nbsp;具体如下</p><p>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p>[root@centos-cluster-s19423 ~]# mysql&nbsp; -uroot&nbsp;-p123456;</p><p>mysql: [Warning] Using a password on the command line interface can be insecure.</p><p>Welcome to the MySQL monitor.&nbsp;Commands end with ; or \\g.</p><p>Your MySQL connection id is 5</p><p>Server version: 5.7.26-log MySQL Community Server (GPL)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Copyright (c) 2000, 2019, Oracle and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Oracle is a registered trademark of Oracle Corporation and/or its</p><p>affiliates. Other names may be trademarks of their respective</p><p>owners.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Type \'help;\' or \'\\h\' for help. Type \'\\c\' to clear the current input statement.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>mysql&gt; set global sql_slave_skip_counter=1;&nbsp;</p><p>Query OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>mysql&gt; stop slave;&nbsp;</p><p>Query OK, 0 rows affected (0.02 sec)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>mysql&gt; start slave;</p><p>Query OK, 0 rows affected (0.00 sec)</p><p>备库因为某些错误停止时有发生，最常见的错误就是”HA_ERR_KEY_NOT_FOUND”和 “HA_ERR_FOUND_DUPP_KEY”.这既有可能是主备切换导致的，也可能是MySQL Bug导致的</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>通常有两种办法来处理备库错误：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1).&nbsp;设置 “sql_slave_skip_counter”来忽略错误. 1</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2).set slave_exec_mode = “idempotent”来处理 “HA_ERR_FOUND_DUPP_KEY” (overwritten the record)&nbsp;和”HA_ERR_KEY_NOT_FOUND”(简单的忽略掉错误).&nbsp;未验证</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>这两种方法都可能导致主备不一致</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>','project','','华侨城','mysql,数据库,主主同步',1,1,'2026-01-05 08:12:47.845279','2026-01-05 08:12:47.959430',4),(5,'华侨城服务器重启导致mysql启动失败问题处理','<p>华侨城用户，在会管运行过程中重启操作系统，导致MySQL异常、服务启动失败，MySQL错误日志见文档末尾。</p><p><br>处理方案：在my.ini文件[mysqld]模块下添加 innodb_force_recovery = 1，之后启动MySQL服务，再关闭服务后注释此项，再次启动MySQL恢复使用。</p><p><br>备注：innodb_force_recovery是一个启动选项，用于在MySQL服务器启动时强制InnoDB存储引擎执行恢复操作。它允许数据库管理员在数据库系统无法正常启动或表无法访问时，尝试恢复数据。<br>配置的数值是恢复级别，通常为0-6。<br>0 (默认): 不进行任何恢复操作，MySQL 服务器将正常启动。<br>1: 允许以只读模式启动。这可以让你查看数据但不进行写操作。<br>2: 允许以只读模式启动，并且不进行崩溃恢复，这可能导致一些数据文件损坏。<br>3: 启动但不修复任何已损坏的表，也不重建索引。<br>4: 启动但不修复任何已损坏的表，也不重建索引，也不加载外键约束。<br>5: 类似于级别 4，但会尝试恢复未提交的事务。<br>6: 完全跳过日志恢复过程，启动但不进行任何崩溃恢复。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>MySQL异常日志：</p><p>2025-02-16T03:36:37.015599Z 5 [System] [MY-010558] [Repl] Slave for channel \'\': received end packet from server due to dump thread being killed on master. Dump threads are killed for example during master shutdown, explicitly by a user, or when the master receives a binlog send request from a duplicate server UUID &lt;fac5c42f-5c44-11ed-a5ad-005056bd6a82&gt; : Error&nbsp;<br>2025-02-16T03:36:37.016673Z 5 [Warning] [MY-010897] [Repl] Storing MySQL user name or password information in the master info repository is not secure and is therefore not recommended. Please consider using the USER and PASSWORD connection options for START SLAVE; see the \'START SLAVE Syntax\' in the MySQL Manual for more information.<br>2025-02-16T03:36:38.019395Z 5 [ERROR] [MY-010584] [Repl] Slave I/O for channel \'\': error reconnecting to master \'copy_95@172.16.7.95:3306\' - retry-time: 10 retries: 1 message: Can\'t connect to MySQL server on \'172.16.7.95:3306\' (10061), Error_code: MY-002003<br>2025-02-16T03:36:57.196145Z 5 [ERROR] [MY-010584] [Repl] Slave I/O for channel \'\': error reconnecting to master \'copy_95@172.16.7.95:3306\' - retry-time: 10 retries: 2 message: Can\'t connect to MySQL server on \'172.16.7.95:3306\' (10061), Error_code: MY-002003<br>2025-02-16T03:37:08.207384Z 5 [ERROR] [MY-010584] [Repl